    LLM: "Draw from stock (discard pile only if immediately melding). Meld sets (3-4 same rank) or runs (3+ sequential same suit). 7s special: only need 2 cards for meld (7-7 valid set, 6-7 valid run). Single 7 = 1-card meld. Lay off on any player's melds. Discard to end turn. All-at-once go-out = double score.",
    Player: "Draw from stock (discard pile only if immediately melding). Meld sets (3-4 same rank) or runs (3+ sequential same suit). 7s special: only need 2 cards for meld (7-7 valid set, 6-7 valid run). Single 7 = 1-card meld. Lay off on any player's melds. Discard to end turn. All-at-once go-out = double score.",
